# P6 — production Lambda rejects descriptions over 1KB (L2 input validation).
#
# Given the deployed Lambda Function URL
# When  a valid request with a >1KB description is sent with the API key
# Then  the response is HTTP 400 with an explicit error message.
POST {{base_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{api_key}}

{"ref":1,"description":"","stock":5,"price":100}
HTTP 400
[Asserts]
jsonpath "$.error" == "description exceeds 1KB"
